{"last_link_id": 6, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "gen_model", "links": [2], "label": "gen_model", "type": "WOOSH_GEN_MODEL", "localized_name": "gen_model"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-326.0415954589844, 1340.07763671875], "widgets_values": ["Woosh-VFlow-8s"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "WooshLoadFlow", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Woosh", "ver": "283b9b1a8efba182e8c08433cdde7f6bb58a9ff7", "widget_ue_connectable": {"model_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "WooshLoadFlow"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text_conditioning", "links": [3], "label": "text_conditioning", "type": "WOOSH_TEXT_COND", "localized_name": "text_conditioning"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-326.8680419921875, 1478.920654296875], "widgets_values": ["V2A — video to audio (VFlow/DVFlow)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "WooshTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Woosh", "ver": "283b9b1a8efba182e8c08433cdde7f6bb58a9ff7", "widget_ue_connectable": {"mode": true}, "Node name for S&R": "WooshTextEncode"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [4], "label": "video", "type": "WOOSH_VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-330.6547546386719, 1593.6314697265625], "widgets_values": ["", 8], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image_batch", "link": 1, "label": "image_batch", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_batch"}, {"widget": {"name": "video_path"}, "shape": 7, "name": "video_path", "label": "video_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration_s"}, "shape": 7, "name": "max_duration_s", "label": "max_duration_s", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration_s"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "WooshLoadVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Woosh", "ver": "283b9b1a8efba182e8c08433cdde7f6bb58a9ff7", "widget_ue_connectable": {"video_path": true, "max_duration_s": true}, "Node name for S&R": "WooshLoadVideo"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 88], "pos": [448.4169921875, 1343.7669677734375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 5, "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "PreviewAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.22.3", "widget_ue_connectable": {"audioUI": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [447.5542297363281, 1493.054931640625], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 6, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.22.3", "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true, "quality": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["V2A 视频 生成音效工作流\n\n操作步骤：\n第一步：加载视频节点“上传视频”\n第二步：Woosh Sampler 节点 输入提示词\n\n逐个节点各参数的含义：\n\n1. Load Video (Upload) — VideoHelperSuite 节点，负责读取视频文件\n\n①`video` :    你上传的视频文件名（当前是\"测试生成音效.mp4\"）。\n②`force_rate`:   强制转换帧率，设为\"30\" 表示会把视频统一转成30fps读取（0表示不强制，用视频本身的帧率）—— **这个很重要，决定了送进后面节点的画面节奏**。\n③`custom_width` / `custom_height`：强制缩放画面尺寸，0表示不缩放，用原始分辨率。\n④ `frame_load_cap`：| 最多读取多少帧，当前 “125” 帧（配合30fps，等于约4.2秒）。\n⑤`skip_first_frames`： 跳过开头多少帧不读，当前0 。\n⑥`select_every_nth` ：每隔几帧取一帧，1表示逐帧不跳过。\n⑦`format` ： 输出格式适配（AnimateDiff是给AI视频类节点用的通用格式）。\n⑧ 输出 `图像(IMAGE)` ： 读出来的画面帧序列，接给下面的 Video Loader 。\n\n2. Woosh Video Loader — 把画面帧包装成 Woosh 认得的格式\n\n① `image_batch` ： 接收上面读出来的画面帧。|\n② `video_path`： 备用方式：也可以直接填视频文件路径代替上面的上传方式（现在留空，因为走的是上传） 。\n③ `max_duration_s`： 最长处理时长上限，当前 **8.0秒**（防止视频太长导致处理量爆炸；你的视频是4秒不受影响）。\n④输出 `video` ：处理好的视频数据，接给 Sampler 。\n\n3. Woosh Model Loader — 加载生成模型本体\n\n① `model_name` ： 选择具体用哪个模型权重，当前 **Woosh-VFlow-8s**（完整版、非蒸馏、专门针对约8秒视频设计） 。\n② `model_type` ： 告诉程序这个模型对应哪种推理逻辑，当前 **VFlow**（对应完整版，需要50步） 。\n\n选择规则：\nmodel_name: Woosh-Flow →  对应 model_type：选Flow  ，说明：T2A完整版，文字转音效，非蒸馏，效果最好但慢（50步）\nmodel_name:Woosh-DFlow → 对应 model_type：DFlow  说明：T2A快速版，文字转音效，蒸馏模型，快但音质打折（4步）\nmodel_name: Woosh-VFlow-8s\t→  对应 model_type：VFlow  说明：V2A完整版，视频转音效，非蒸馏，效果最好但慢（50步）\nmodel_name: Woosh-DVFlow-8s → 对应 model_type：DVFlow  说明：V2A快速版，视频转音效，蒸馏模型，快但音质打折（4步）\nmodel_name: Woosh-AE  不单独用  说明：\t这是音频编解码器（Audio Encoder），是所有其他模型内部都会用到的底层组件,不是你自己选来跑推理的模型，下拉框里能看到它只是因为它也存在于同一个模型目录里\n\n记忆口诀很简单：\n前缀有没有 \"D\"（比如DFlow/DVFlow）→ 有D就是蒸馏(Distilled)快速版，没D就是完整版\n有没有 \"V\"（比如VFlow/DVFlow）→ 有V就是Video(视频/V2A)，没V就是纯文字(T2A)\n配对规则就是：model_name 里的字母组合，必须跟 model_type 里选的完全一致（去掉文件名里的\"-8s\"这种版本后缀就是type本身）：\n选了 Woosh-VFlow-8s → model_type 必须选 VFlow\n选了 Woosh-DVFlow-8s → model_type 必须选 DVFlow\n\n\n4. Woosh TextConditioning — 文字提示编码器\n\n① `mode` ： 选择编码模式，当前 **V2A**（视频转音效模式，会加载专门给V2A用的文字对齐模型）。\n| 实际文字内容 | 在 Sampler 节点的 `prompt` 框里填写，这个节点本身只决定\"用哪套编码方式\"去理解你填的文字 |\n\n 5. Woosh Sampler — 核心生成节点，真正出声音的地方\n\n① `gen_model` ： 接收上面加载好的生成模型 |\n② `text_conditioning`： 接收文字编码结果 |\n③ `video` ： 接收视频特征 |\n④ 文本框（prompt） ： 你写的音效描述文字，当前是示例占位符\"e.g. sportscar engine revving...\"（**你现在其实还没填自己的描述**，等于空） |\n⑤ `steps` ： 采样步数，越多越精细但越慢，当前 **50**（对应完整版VFlow的标准值） |\n⑥ `cfg` ： 文字提示的影响强度（classifier-free guidance），数值越高越贴合你写的文字描述，但太高可能损失自然度，当前 **4.5** 是官方推荐默认值 |\n⑦ `seed` ： 随机种子，决定这次生成结果的具体细节，配合下面\"生成后控制\"使用 |\n⑧ `生成后控制` ： 每次运行完是否自动换seed，当前 **randomize**（每次都换新的，方便多试几次挑效果最好的） |\n⑨ `latent_frames`： 控制输出音频的时长，公式是\"秒数×100+1\"，当前 **401** 对应你4秒的视频（这是你刚才手动改对的） |\n⑩ `subprocess` ： 是否用独立子进程运行推理（避免拖垮ComfyUI主进程），保持 **true** |\n⑪ `force_offload` : 是否推理完强制把模型从显存卸载，**false** 表示保留在显存里，下次生成能更快，代价是占着显存 |\n\n6. 预览音频 — 播放/试听输出结果\n\n没有参数，就是接收 `audio` 输出，给你听生成好的声音。\n\n---\n\n**回到你说的\"匹配不好\"的问题**：现在看你的Sampler节点里 `prompt` 框还是**没有填自己的描述**，仍然是那个灰色的示例占位文字。建议先把这里换成你视频里实际动作的具体描述（比如\"man walking through doorway, footsteps\"），这一个改动最可能立竿见影地改善匹配度。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [433.70001220703125, 515.4000244140625], "pos": [-1112.7921142578125, 1344.4625244140625], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [1], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "帧计数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "label": "视频信息", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "size": [261.6533203125, 484.9368896484375], "pos": [-651.8153686523438, 1346.3056640625], "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "filename": "3d724dfad1eaa987707cf63c04435aedbe099694e7ce657783df9533d4bb8d30.mp4", "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "format": "video/mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "type": "input"}}, "format": "AnimateDiff", "video": "3d724dfad1eaa987707cf63c04435aedbe099694e7ce657783df9533d4bb8d30.mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "force_size": "Disabled", "choose video to upload": "image"}, "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "meta_batch", "label": "批次管理", "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "localized_name": "meta_batch"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "video"}, "name": "video", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_rate"}, "name": "force_rate", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "强制帧率"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_size"}, "name": "force_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "强制尺寸"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_width"}, "name": "custom_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "custom_width"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_height"}, "name": "custom_height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "custom_height"}, {"widget": {"name": "frame_load_cap"}, "name": "frame_load_cap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "帧数读取上限"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_first_frames"}, "name": "skip_first_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "跳过前X帧"}, {"widget": {"name": "select_every_nth"}, "name": "select_every_nth", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "模选"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "shape": 7, "name": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "VHS_LoadVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-videohelpersuite", "ver": "1.7.9", "widget_ue_connectable": {"custom_height": true, "force_rate": true, "custom_width": true, "select_every_nth": true, "frame_load_cap": true, "format": true, "video": true, "skip_first_frames": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_LoadVideo"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video_frames", "label": "video_frames", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video_frames"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [5, 6], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [400, 296], "pos": [1.75774085521698, 1342.4976806640625], "widgets_values": ["", 50, 4.5, 1149774411, "randomize", 401, true], "inputs": [{"name": "gen_model", "link": 2, "label": "gen_model", "type": "WOOSH_GEN_MODEL", "localized_name": "gen_m